<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89926" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπέμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send to</i>, esp. of messengers or envoys, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					473
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήρυκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινά τινι</span>
			<i>send</i> or <i>conduct</i> one person <i>to</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὸν δεῦρο προσπέμψας ἐμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1349
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.5.18
			</span></i>: simply, c. dat., <i>send</i> to one (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγγελον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.167
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὶ ἵνα</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.2.19
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. λόγους ἔς τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.47
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.108
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς Ὄλυνθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.79
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
